{"title":"引越しできるかな？","uid":"376aa5f89f90dd8bb634896a55dc7c51","slug":"引越しできるかな？","date":"2021-12-10T12:48:44.000Z","updated":"2022-06-06T06:56:40.137Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/引越しできるかな？.json","keywords":"HerikoDeltana,HRiver2,","cover":null,"content":"<p>「藉以此篇，纪念刚学 OI 的我。」</p>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<!-- toc -->\r\n<p>当我今天看我未 AC\r\n的题面时，看到了这道题，想起我当时的样子，看到这个题没有人做，题面还有锅，于是决定<a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/discuss/388551\">提供翻译，以及修复样例</a>，来纪念十一个月前啥都不会的我。</p>\r\n<h1 id=\"引越しできるかな\">引越しできるかな？</h1>\r\n<p><del>你 会 搬 家 吗？</del></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://atcoder.jp/contests/arc013/tasks/arc013_2\">原题链接</a>。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"题目翻译\">题目翻译</h2>\r\n<p>现在有 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>C</em></span>\r\n件长方体物品，给出其长，宽，高，求能够单独放得下每个物体所需最小的长方体盒子的体积。</p>\r\n<p>物品不会倾斜放置。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\">输入格式</h2>\r\n<p>输入共 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>C</em> + 1</span>\r\n行，第一行为一个整数 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>C</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p>第二行到第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>C</em> + 1</span>\r\n行，每行三个整数 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>N</em>, <em>M</em>, <em>L</em></span> 表示第\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 个物体的长宽高。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\">输出格式</h2>\r\n<p>一行一个整数表示所需的最小长方体盒子的体积。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"输入输出样例\">输入输出样例</h2>\r\n<p><strong>输入#1</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>2\r\n10 20 30\r\n20 20 20</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输出#1</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>12000</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输入#2</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>3\r\n10 20 30\r\n20 20 20\r\n30 20 10</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输出#2</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>12000</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输入#3</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>4\r\n10 20 30\r\n20 20 20\r\n30 20 10\r\n10 40 10</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输出#3</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>16000</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输入#4</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>2\r\n10 10 10\r\n11 1 1</code></pre>\r\n<p><strong>输出#4</strong></p>\r\n<pre><code>1100</code></pre>\r\n<h2 id=\"数据范围\">数据范围</h2>\r\n<p>对于 <span class=\"math inline\">40%</span> 的数据，满足 <span class=\"math inline\">1 ≤ <em>C</em> ≤ 10.</span></p>\r\n<p>对于 <span class=\"math inline\">100%</span> 的数据，满足 <span class=\"math inline\">1 ≤ <em>C</em>, <em>N</em>, <em>M</em>, <em>L</em> ≤ 100.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"思路简述\">思路简述</h2>\r\n<p>题面意思很明了，所以直接说做法。</p>\r\n<p>因为我们只需要保证能有一种姿势能放进去就行，所以每次读入的时候按照大小顺序去更新盒子的三维即可。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"code\">Code</h3>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb9\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb9-1\"><a href=\"#cb9-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-2\"><a href=\"#cb9-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-3\"><a href=\"#cb9-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-4\"><a href=\"#cb9-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-5\"><a href=\"#cb9-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;cstring&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-6\"><a href=\"#cb9-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-7\"><a href=\"#cb9-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define Heriko </span><span class=\"cf\">return</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-8\"><a href=\"#cb9-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define Deltana </span><span class=\"dv\">0</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-9\"><a href=\"#cb9-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define Romanno </span><span class=\"dv\">1</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-10\"><a href=\"#cb9-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define S </span><span class=\"dt\">signed</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-11\"><a href=\"#cb9-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define LL </span><span class=\"dt\">long</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span><span class=\"dt\">long</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-12\"><a href=\"#cb9-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define R </span><span class=\"at\">register</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-13\"><a href=\"#cb9-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define I </span><span class=\"kw\">inline</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-14\"><a href=\"#cb9-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define CI </span><span class=\"at\">const</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span><span class=\"dt\">int</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-15\"><a href=\"#cb9-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define mkp</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span>b<span class=\"op\">)</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span>make_pair<span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span>b<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-16\"><a href=\"#cb9-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define mst</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span>b<span class=\"op\">)</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span>memset<span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">,</span>b<span class=\"op\">,</span><span class=\"kw\">sizeof</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>a<span class=\"op\">))</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-17\"><a href=\"#cb9-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define ON </span><span class=\"bu\">std::</span>ios<span class=\"bu\">::</span>sync_with_stdio<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">false</span><span class=\"op\">);</span>cin<span class=\"op\">.</span>tie<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-18\"><a href=\"#cb9-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#define Files</span><span class=\"op\">()</span><span class=\"pp\"> </span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">\"RNMTQ.in\"</span><span class=\"op\">,</span><span class=\"st\">\"r\"</span><span class=\"op\">,</span>stdin<span class=\"op\">);</span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">\"RNMTQ.out\"</span><span class=\"op\">,</span><span class=\"st\">\"w\"</span><span class=\"op\">,</span>stdout<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-19\"><a href=\"#cb9-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-20\"><a href=\"#cb9-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">using</span> <span class=\"kw\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-21\"><a href=\"#cb9-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-22\"><a href=\"#cb9-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"kw\">template</span><span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw\">typename</span> J<span class=\"op\">&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-23\"><a href=\"#cb9-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>I <span class=\"dt\">void</span> fr<span class=\"op\">(</span>J <span class=\"op\">&amp;</span>x<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-24\"><a href=\"#cb9-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-25\"><a href=\"#cb9-25\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">short</span> f<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-26\"><a href=\"#cb9-26\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    x<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-27\"><a href=\"#cb9-27\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">char</span> c<span class=\"op\">(</span>getchar<span class=\"op\">());</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb9-28\"><a href